{"row_key": "S6_01_INVARIANTS:A1.3", "source_compendium_paper": "I", "source_compendium_label": "inv:A1.3", "source_file": "fragments/part_A.tex, Statement A1.3", "source_line": 2737, "source_section": "The cotangent direct images and the decisive period scalar", "placement_basis": "candidate body placement; source-credit and proof reviews pending", "placement_state": "provisional editorial mapping; no current mathematical validation inferred", "source_kind": "Proposition", "source_statement": "\begin{proposition}[All absolute cotangent direct images]\label{inv:A1.3}\label{wb:prop:absolute-cotangent-direct-images}
For every admissible $c$, the six direct images are
\begin{equation}\label{inv:eq:A-absolute-table}
\begin{array}{c|cc}
q&R^qf_*\Omega_X^1&R^qf_*\Omega_X^2\\\hline
0&\OO(-2)&\OO(-2)\oplus\OO(-1)\\
1&\OO\oplus\OO(-1)^2&\OO(-2)\oplus\OO(-1)^2\\
2&\OO\oplus\OO(-1)&\OO.
\end{array}
\end{equation}
In particular every listed sheaf is torsion-free.
