{"row_key": "S6_03_CDP:A.3.3", "source_compendium_paper": "II", "source_compendium_label": "cdp:st:A.3.3", "source_file": "sections/part_A.tex; Statement A.3.3", "source_line": 3122, "source_section": "Cotangent torsion, conductor and the printed endpoint error", "placement_basis": "candidate body placement; source-credit and proof reviews pending", "placement_state": "provisional editorial mapping; no current mathematical validation inferred", "source_kind": "Proposition", "source_statement": "\begin{proposition}[The precise finite-translation step in Remarks 7.2 and 7.4]\label{cdp:st:A.3.3}
For a fixed multiple fibre $mS$, suppose that the set of line bundles $B$ for which $H^0(S,(\Omega_Y^1\otimes B)|_S)=0$ contains a dense open subset $U$ of the relevant Picard component. The intersection
\[
\bigcap_{j=0}^{m-1}\{B:B\otimes\OO_Y(-jS)\in U\}
\tag{A.14}\label{cdp:eq:A.14}
\]
is a dense open subset on which the full-fibre ambient group vanishes, whenever the displayed translations preserve that component. The same assertion for a finite union of components follows by using the appropriate dense open subset in each translated component.
\end{proposition}", "historical_literature_checks": {"found_in_AC26": "{"status": "not_found_in_checked_scope", "full_statement_found": false, "terms_searched": ["finite.translation", "multiple fibre", "Remark 7.4"], "search_record": "deliverables/work/cdp_audit/credit_searches_239.json#A.3.3|AC26", "searched_files": [{"path": "sources/original/AC26_transcription.tex", "sha256": "9e87e12175c70040ed66ab6513172a1f952c96205601c0910f48712c42445170", "hit_count": 6}, {"path": "sources/external/root/AC26_pdf_text.txt", "sha256": "e3a403c0ef610e2aefb22f56b59dd495931dc7015b045cdc30f1403a31a65040", "hit_count": 9}], "actual_reading_scope_record": "deliverables/work/cdp_audit/credit_context_readings.json#AC26", "matches": [], "relation": "No full matching receiving statement was identified within the listed queries and actually read contexts. Related construction data or general lemmas may occur; the saved hit list is not a claim that every hit was read."}", "found_in_E26": "{"status": "not_found_in_checked_scope", "full_statement_found": false, "terms_searched": ["finite.translation", "multiple fibre", "Remark 7.4"], "search_record": "deliverables/work/cdp_audit/credit_searches_239.json#A.3.3|E26", "searched_files": [{"path": "sources/papers/arXiv_2609.38442_Engel_src/S6.tex", "sha256": "95ea78327c33351d609a3001539756f0043dfdef13a37a81927608c953c98c36", "hit_count": 0}], "actual_reading_scope_record": "deliverables/work/cdp_audit/credit_context_readings.json#E26", "matches": [], "relation": "No full matching receiving statement was identified within the listed queries and actually read contexts. Related construction data or general lemmas may occur; the saved hit list is not a claim that every hit was read."}", "found_in_DGKX_v1": "{"status": "not_found_in_checked_scope", "full_statement_found": false, "terms_searched": ["finite.translation", "multiple fibre", "Remark 7.4"], "search_record": "deliverables/work/cdp_audit/credit_searches_239.json#A.3.3|DGKX_v1", "searched_file