{"row_key": "S6_03_CDP:C.2.NC.1", "source_compendium_paper": "II", "source_compendium_label": "cdp:st:C.2.NC.1", "source_file": "sections/part_C2_NC.tex; Statement C.2.NC.1", "source_line": 53086, "source_section": "Known source results re-derived", "placement_basis": "inventory kind and plan condition 2", "placement_state": "provisional editorial mapping; no current mathematical validation inferred", "source_kind": "Cited/re-derived", "source_statement": "\begin{proposition}[Credited re-derivation: The local-to-global Euler formula with multiplicities and self-intersections]\label{cdp:st:C.2.NC.1}
Let $g:U\to\Delta$ be a proper holomorphic map from a smooth complex threefold to a disc, smooth over $\Delta^*$, whose central fibre is $\sum_i m_iS_i$ and whose reduced support $S$ has normal crossings. Let $\nu:\coprod_i T_i\to S$ be normalization and let $D_i\subset T_i$ be its reduced conductor divisor. For a sufficiently small nonzero $t$,
\[
 e(U_t)=\sum_i m_i e(T_i\setminus D_i).
 \tag{C.NC.1}\label{cdp:eq:C.NC.1}
\]
The formula does not require a Kähler total space, a polarization, uniform multiplicities, or simple normal crossings.
\end{proposition}", "historical_literature_checks": {"found_in_AC26": "{"status": "not_found_in_checked_scope", "full_statement_found": false, "terms_searched": ["normal.crossing", "multiplicit", "Euler"], "search_record": "deliverables/work/cdp_audit/credit_searches_239.json#C.2.NC.1|AC26", "searched_files": [{"path": "sources/original/AC26_transcription.tex", "sha256": "9e87e12175c70040ed66ab6513172a1f952c96205601c0910f48712c42445170", "hit_count": 30}, {"path": "sources/external/root/AC26_pdf_text.txt", "sha256": "e3a403c0ef610e2aefb22f56b59dd495931dc7015b045cdc30f1403a31a65040", "hit_count": 35}], "actual_reading_scope_record": "deliverables/work/cdp_audit/credit_context_readings.json#AC26", "matches": [], "relation": "No full matching receiving statement was identified within the listed queries and actually read contexts. Related construction data or general lemmas may occur; the saved hit list is not a claim that every hit was read."}", "found_in_E26": "{"status": "not_found_in_checked_scope", "full_statement_found": false, "terms_searched": ["normal.crossing", "multiplicit", "Euler"], "search_record": "deliverables/work/cdp_audit/credit_searches_239.json#C.2.NC.1|E26", "searched_files": [{"path": "sources/papers/arXiv_2609.38442_Engel_src/S6.tex", "sha256": "95ea78327c33351d609a3001539756f0043dfdef13a37a81927608c953c98c36", "hit_count": 11}], "actual_reading_scope_record": "deliverables/work/cdp_audit/credit_context_readings.json#E26", "matches": [], "relation": "No full matching receiving statement was identified within the listed queries and actually read contexts. Related construction data or general lemmas may occur; the saved hit list is not a claim that every hit was read."}", "found_in_DGKX_v1": "{"status": "not_found_in_checked_scope", "full_statement_found": false, "terms_searched": ["normal.crossing", "multiplicit", "Euler"], "search_record": "deliverables/work/cdp_audit/credit_searches_239.json#C.2.NC.1|DGKX_v1", "searched_files": [{"path": "source