d": "deliverables/work/cdp_audit/credit_searches_239.json#C.2.MH.3|DGKX_v1", "searched_files": [{"path": "sources/papers/arXiv_2610.00250v1_Du_Guo_Kusakabe_Xie_src/v5oka_maps_modifications_deformations.tex", "sha256": "924a4a72d80793927f3104121a44786ea2b9869ae6ea2bca5a6a69553ab2884e", "hit_count": 140}], "actual_reading_scope_record": "deliverables/work/cdp_audit/credit_context_readings.json#DGKX_v1", "matches": [], "relation": "No full matching receiving statement was identified within the listed queries and actually read contexts. Related construction data or general lemmas may occur; the saved hit list is not a claim that every hit was read."}", "found_elsewhere": "{"status": "not_found_in_checked_scope", "full_statement_found": false, "matches": [], "cited_opened_inputs": [], "additional_attached_search_record": "deliverables/work/cdp_audit/credit_elsewhere_searches_239.json#C.2.MH.3", "terms_searched": ["mixed.Hodge", "normali[sz]ation", "Euler", "elliptic", "contract", "rational"], "corpus_size_files": 43, "bounded_absence_statement": "Beyond the explicit positive matches and opened general inputs, no full counterpart was identified in the executed attached-source searches and stated context readings. This is not an exhaustive priority search of all literature.", "existing_scoped_credit_notes": ""}"}, "historical_source_notes": "SOURCE STATEMENT: Every contracted irrational horizontal section is elliptic and contributes Euler number zero | SOURCE STATUS: Proved | SOURCE NOTES: The exact previously unresolved count is n=v-N0. This is a theorem for the actual torus fibre, obtained from its finite-character support comparison, not an assertion about arbitrary abstract anticanonical pairs. Parent and independent assigned agents accepted the complete proof. Later UN7 proves e(S)>=2 and pi1(S)=1 for contracted irrational sections, so that configuration is excluded under CDP; the earlier necessary reductions are retained without an existence assertion. | remarks: e(S