{"row_key": "S6_04_MAPS_MANIFOLDS:F.2.6", "source_compendium_paper": "III", "source_compendium_label": "maps:src:F.2.6", "source_file": "sections/fourfolds.tex: F.2.6", "source_line": 24929, "source_section": "The rank-three search and a parity obstruction", "placement_basis": "candidate body placement; source-credit and proof reviews pending", "placement_state": "provisional editorial mapping; no current mathematical validation inferred", "source_kind": "Theorem", "source_statement": "\begin{theorem}[integral three-connectivity of the candidate]\label{maps:src:F.2.6}

The manifold of Theorem \ref{maps:src:F.2.5} has free integral homology with
Betti numbers \eqref{maps:eq:F.5}.  In particular $H_2=H_3=0$, and it is
three-connected.

\end{theorem}", "historical_literature_checks": {"found_in_AC26": "No explicit nonselfdual (5,4) rank-six eight-manifold statement located by the recorded terms.", "found_in_E26": "No explicit nonselfdual (5,4) rank-six eight-manifold statement located by the recorded terms.", "found_in_DGKX_v1": "The inspected phrase about three connected fillings is not three-connectivity of an eight-manifold; no full matching assertion identified.", "found_elsewhere": "The original receiving proof is supplemented by the fully printed actual torsion d2 calculation (primitive theta=a+4k); finite Smith data alone were insufficient. This repaired integral conclusion is distinct from the earlier rational result."}, "historical_source_notes": "SOURCE STATEMENT: The explicit (5,4) candidate has free integral homology with H4=Z4 and is three-connected. | SOURCE STATUS: Proved | SOURCE NOTES: Integral finite covering lattices and torsion-cap differentials Z/2 to Z/2 computed explicitly; the period construction is now supplied in F.3.5--F.3.7. | audit_notes: Scoped progress, not a complete-chain certification. F.3.11 gives bounded correction at one retained cusp; it does not establish simultaneous good reduction at every finite puncture. | The previously unexamined geometric torsion-transgression step is closed by a full proof and exact arithmetic checks. This is not certification of the independent rank-three cusp-existence and remaining Leray inputs. | Separate DGKXv2 comparison: The inspected phrase about three connected fillings is not three-connectivity of an eight-manifold; no full matching assertion identified. | Final bounded source comparison: work/maps_audit/maps60_credit_comparison.json | source_blocks: [{"id": "F.2.6", "file": "sources/returns/S6_04_MAPS_MANIFOLDS/sections/fourfolds.tex", "start_line": 1019, "end_line": 1142, "source_sha256": "19ceb389423e80bf1e63e8ac36718a2b26c59e2fa0e033462604af5416ec24c7"}] | Final receiving/dependency event: work/maps_audit/III_maps60_final