urce1125–1202; construction comparison3130–3304.", "relation": "Known underlying marked complex torus/sphere family and cusp/finite-fillings data only. The localized retained-angle quotient, exact radial restriction and target are specified constructions. Sphere smash identities, suspension homology and the Kunneth computation are classical; no matching full marked construction was found in the compared contexts.", "terms_searched": ["S.?12", "smash", "suspension", "cone.*torus"], "search_record": "deliverables/work/cdp_audit/carrier_credit/searches_164.json#cusp-cone-S12-route|DGKX_v2", "searched_file": "sources/papers/arXiv_2610.00250v2_Du_Guo_Kusakabe_Xie_src/submited-tams.tex", "searched_sha256": "a2013b8390b1eba4f9c57eb78597eb3b8b6ac09c50714492c6912803a8bebe50", "hit_count": 1, "context_record": "deliverables/work/cdp_audit/carrier_credit/context_readings.json#DGKX_v2"}}"}, "historical_source_notes": "No final-run row identified yet; preserve as separate working result.; overlap_status=additional working-edition result; start_line=118; source_sha256=b081f9dd31ac8e9e477a162cd1faeec4b8a3319a9ce29ed286fa32069579c5c6 | source_sha256: b081f9dd31ac8e9e477a162cd1faeec4b8a3319a9ce29ed286fa32069579c5c6 | Final bounded source comparison: work/cdp_audit/carrier_credit/working_credit_inventory_overlay_39.json | Final receiving/dependency event: work/maps_audit/III_final_closure_overlay.json"}

{"row_key": "working_edition:cusp-cone-S24-local-route", "source_compendium_paper": "III", "source_compendium_label": "wb:cusp-cone-S24-local-route", "source_file": "sources/workbench/cusp_cone_sphere_routes.tex", "source_line": 36625, "source_section": "Local covers, global quotients and cusp carriers", "placement_basis": "candidate body placement; source-credit and proof reviews pending", "placement_state": "provisional editorial mapping; no current mathematical validation inferred", "source_kind": "Proposition", "source_statement": "\begin{proposition}[Localized \(S^{24}\) route with target
\(\operatorname{Susp}(T^2)^{\wedge4}\)]
\label{wb:cusp-cone-S24-local-route}
There is a continuous surjective based quotient map
\begin{equation}
 q_{1,\mathrm{cusp}}:(X,x_0)\longrightarrow(\mathcal B,b_0)
 \label{wb:cusp-cone-q1-local}
\end{equation}
given by
\begin{equation}
 q_{1,\mathrm{cusp}}(x)
 =[r,e^{i\phi},\theta_\gamma(x)]
 \quad(0<|t|=r<\epsilon),\qquad
 q_{1,\mathrm{cusp}}(W)=b_0,\qquad
 q_{1,\mathrm{cusp}}
 \bigl(X\setminus\operatorname{int}N_0\bigr)=b_1.
 \label{wb:cusp-cone-q1-local-formula}
\end{equation}
Its fourth smash power has source \(X^{\wedge4}\cong S^{24}\), and on
four synchronized radial fibres it is exactly
\begin{equation}
 \chi_{\gamma,T}^{\times4}:F_T^4\longrightarrow C_T^4.
 \label{wb:cusp-cone-S24-local-fibre-map}
\end{equation}
Consequently its intrinsic target slices satisfy the Euclidean limit
\cref{wb:cusp-cone-S24-R4-limit}.  The target homology is
\begin{equation}
 \widetilde H_k(\mathcal B;\mathbb Z)\cong
 \begin{cases}
  \mathbb Z^2,&k=2,\\
  \mathbb Z,&k=3,\\
  0,&\text{otherwise},
 \end{cases}
 \label{wb:cusp-cone-B-homology}
\end{equation}
and
\begin{equation}
 \widetilde H_k(\mathcal B^{\wedge4};\mathbb Z)\cong
 \begin{cases}
  \mathbb Z^{16},&k=8,\\
  \mathbb Z^{32},&k=9,\\
  \mathbb Z^{24},&k=10,\\
  \mathbb Z^8,&k=11,\\
  \mathbb Z,&k=12,\\
  0,&\text{otherwise}.
 \end{cases}
 \label{wb:cusp-cone-B-smash-homology}
\end{equation}
