{"row_key": "WORKING_INV:prop:log-relative-direct-images", "source_compendium_paper": "I", "source_compendium_label": "inv:A1.2", "source_file": "workbench/hodge_frolicher.tex", "source_line": 2663, "source_section": "The cotangent direct images and the decisive period scalar", "placement_basis": "candidate body placement; source-credit and proof reviews pending", "placement_state": "provisional editorial mapping; no current mathematical validation inferred", "source_kind": "Proposition", "source_statement": "\begin{proposition}[The logarithmic direct images by vertical twisting and duality]\label{inv:A1.2}\label{wb:prop:log-relative-direct-images}
One has, as holomorphic vector bundles on $B$,
\[
\begin{array}{c|ccc}
q&0&1&2\\\hline
R^qf_*\mathcal E&\OO\oplus\OO(-1)&
 \OO^2\oplus\OO(-1)^2&\OO\oplus\OO(-1).
\end{array}
\]
They commute with base change to every full scheme fibre.
